  "sources": [
    "NOAA NCEI ETOPO 2022 60 arc-second, surface (ice) on EGM2008 \u002B its EGM2008 geoid grid (public domain); below sea level at the geoid",
    "the world\u0027s own ground colour (CoverPalette) over its region, feathered 5 km into it, stored for the Cartoon globe",
    "NASA Earth Observatory, Blue Marble Next Generation with topography and bathymetry, 2004, monthly, 21600 x 10800 (credit NASA Earth Observatory)",
    "levels 0-13: averaged from 2412 level-14 leaves (swissALTI3D 0.5 m (LHN95 -\u003E WGS84 by SwissGeodesy); swissTLM3D roads: tunnel portal holes (LV95 -\u003E WGS84 by SwissGeodesy); road network (RoadGen\u0027s network stage on work frames, #1507); swissTLM3D area layers and the cover overrides: land cover at every leaf vertex (LV95 -\u003E WGS84 by SwissGeodesy); swissBATHY3D lake beds, synthetic beds elsewhere (WaterBed); swissBUILDINGS3D 3.0 with GWR (LV95 -\u003E WGS84 by SwissGeodesy)), past them the game\u0027s 500 m Swiss relief (swisstopo swissALTIRegio), then ETOPO",
    "the shipped base (#1656): 6-bit lattices, colour 64\u00B2 for months 1,4,7,10 on levels 0-4"
  ],
